{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/41g316","slideIndex":0,"text":"Hello, I’m Charith Kalhara, a Computer Science student at IIT Sri Lanka, affiliated with the University of Westminster. My professional brand is rooted in software development and cloud engineering. I’m interested in how digital solutions are designed, built, and made dependable for the people who use them.\n\nI want to be known as someone who connects software development with reliable cloud services. This combination reflects the technical areas I’m studying and the direction I’m choosing for my professional growth. In the next few minutes, I’ll outline the strengths I’m building, the values I want to bring to work, and my career direction.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
