{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jn63eb","slideIndex":1,"text":"My technical foundation spans application development, cloud platforms, delivery automation and operations. I’m building applications with technologies such as Laravel, PHP, Filament and MySQL. I’ve also worked with AWS and Oracle Cloud, Docker, GitHub Actions and Linux. Alongside that, I’m learning cloud-native tools including Kubernetes, Terraform and Ansible.\n\nThe strength I want to make distinctive is an end-to-end view. I’m interested in how an application is developed, how it reaches users, and what helps it run reliably. That perspective helps me connect the different parts of software delivery instead of treating them as separate skills. I’m continuing to develop these capabilities through my studies and technical practice.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
