{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/d98ao3","slideIndex":3,"text":"My career direction is cloud and DevOps engineering. I want to deepen my understanding of cloud infrastructure, strengthen my ability to automate deployment, and learn how to improve the reliability of services. I plan to do this through continued study, hands-on technical practice and collaboration with other developers.\n\nMy longer-term vision is to help build cloud services that are useful, secure and dependable. I want my work to combine sound software engineering with thoughtful operations, while keeping the people who rely on the technology in mind.\n\nTo sum up, my professional brand brings together software development, cloud engineering, responsibility and continuous learning. I’m Charith Kalhara, and I’m working toward becoming an engineer who builds systems people can trust. Thank you.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}